Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:04.22,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}We are living our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:12.17,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Abound with so much information
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:18.11,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Come on,let go of the remote
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:20.18,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Don't you know you're letting all the junk flood in?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:23.08,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I try to stop the flow, double-clicking on the go, but it's no use
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.30,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Hey,I'm being consumed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:28.27,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Loading loading loading, quickly reaching maximum capacity
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:32.66,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Warning warning warning, gonna short circuit my identity(Ah…)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:36.47,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Get up on your feet, tear down the walls
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:40.70,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Catch a glimpse of the hollow world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:44.40,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Snooping 'round will get you nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:48.51,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}You're locked up in your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:53.28,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}We're all trapped in a maze of relationships
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:56.70,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Life goes on with or without you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:03:00.89,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I swim the sea of the unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:07.08,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I search of your heart, pursuing my true self
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//-------------------ED--------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.57,0:22:59.52,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}glaciers of ideas importing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.52,0:23:00.88,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}to my friends then exporting
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.88,0:23:02.29,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}to the next keeping it open
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.29,0:23:03.20,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}we want no closing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.20,0:23:05.21,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}even without doughs our thoughts can be dope and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:06.85,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}this mind trade no one can stop
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.79,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}and act of thinking is terrible to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:10.53,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}we just wanna change up not drop
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.53,0:23:12.54,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}and my crew can rock it like uprock
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.59,0:23:14.47,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}life is tedious if it ain't flowing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.47,0:23:16.30,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}copy and paste? constant defaulting?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.30,0:23:17.99,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}put my courage to it,begin showing off
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.99,0:23:19.18,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}that's the way we wanna live
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:20.06,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}keep going yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.11,0:23:21.52,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}what was so much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:23.51,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}of transparency
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:28.12,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}turned into bright expectation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.12,0:23:32.98,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}my instinct tells me to keep going together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.00,0:23:34.72,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}going together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.87,0:23:41.39,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}it's breathtaking moments in life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:42.59,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}addicted to it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.59,0:23:45.58,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}minds craving
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:48.97,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}more and more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.08,0:23:50.16,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I'm believing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:53.76,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}you and I can do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.76,0:23:57.51,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}we can change the world
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.26,0:24:01.90,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}hey sky's the limit we can spread wings
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:08.19,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}to roadless travel together we go
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//-------------------IN--------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.93,0:21:37.29,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:39.86,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Naked truth lies only if you realize
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.95,0:21:42.79,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Appearing in nobody's eyes till they sterilize
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:45.48,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Stop the guerrilla warfare to keep it fair
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:48.52,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Bro charges your rage to a smarter greater cause
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:51.31,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}You know the stake is high stardom is near
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:54.06,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Those who sympathized you die killers pass by
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.84,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Do not waste your time in hating flirting guys
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:58.93,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Use your might to AIs do justice to them all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.93,0:22:02.02,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Now I face out I hold out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:05.29,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I reach out to the truth of my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:10.54,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Seeking to seize on the whole moment to now break away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:13.37,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Oh God let me out Can you let me out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:17.14,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Can you set me free from this dark inner world
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:21.25,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Save me now Last beat in the soul
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------PREV-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到天鹅绒房间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  这还真是来了位拥有奇怪命运的客人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小人的名字是伊戈尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是客人您旅程的伴游
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做玛格丽特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.89,0:00:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是存在于梦幻与现实
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精神与物质的夹缝之间的场所
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里原本是只有签订了契约之人才能访问的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种未来说不定就在不远的前方等待着您
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.29,0:01:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  直到我们重逢之时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多保重
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸣上！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}（东京土特产）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是悠闲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八十稻羽  八十稻羽  终点站到了
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------TITLE-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:20.31,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,80)}#01  汝即为吾  吾即为汝
Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------TXTA-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:29.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里还真是个什么都没有的地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  你已经到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比照片上看起来更像个男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.93,0:03:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是长大了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得不久前你还穿着尿布呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可真是头疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你已经从你母亲那里听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是她的弟弟  堂岛辽太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边的是我女儿  菜菜子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊  这家伙在害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:06.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演歌歌手的柊美铃小姐居然和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年刚刚入赘的稻羽市议员的秘书  生田目太郎先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  因为父母的原因而转学到这种地方来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也真不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之虽然只有一年  但还请多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想上厕所…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.91,0:04:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临～
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:47.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你是高中生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:49.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在招收打工者  你有兴趣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:56.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自大城市的你对这什么都没有的乡下感到很吃惊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:05:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不打打工的话  我觉得会很无聊的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之你考虑下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  我得回去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你久等了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你晕车了吗  脸色看起来很糟糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  我没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:31.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经历长途跋涉  你也累了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早点回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:50.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想大家都已经知道了  鸣上决定要转校了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他的父母要到国外去工作…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今后  我就要在这里住一年吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你想知道真相？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是梦吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就来试着抓住我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁…啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.11,0:06:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你们快点给我坐好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来介绍一下转校生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是从浮华的都市被排挤到这偏僻乡下的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是俗话说的落魄武士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.69,0:06:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  快点进行自我介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫鸣上悠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才向窗边的女生暗送秋波了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你这家伙的名字记录在坏学生名册上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.37,0:07:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我听好了  这里和你至今为止生活的低俗的城市…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转校生可以坐在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快去给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙叫做诸金  糟糕透了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.09,0:07:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我安静
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在开始开班会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雾？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么今天的课程就到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天开始就要上正课了  你们给我做好心理准备吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看了那个传闻中的「午夜电视」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命中注定的另一半居然是山野女主播
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}现在通知全校学生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}学校附近发生了案件  请大家冷静  迅速地回家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,案件是指什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉真不舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}重复一次  通知全校学生…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸣上同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是一个人回家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:26.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的话要不要和我们一起回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面好像有点乱糟糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是里中千枝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边是天城雪子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然叫住你  真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪子别道歉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来我岂不是像个没礼貌的人一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是稍微想和转校生说说话而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  里中同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个非常有趣  谢谢你  那么再见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事  光盘都裂开了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的「成龙传说」啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  这是个意外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我拿到打工的工资前请先忍一忍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了  雪子  花村什么的别管了  我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是先把他放在一边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂足立  你要当菜鸟当到什么时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要立刻回总厅去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  对不…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个惨烈的案件啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  来人…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了  谢谢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是叫鸣上  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是花村阳介
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你知道这个城市的特产吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛扒啊  是牛扒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看这土里土气的名称  不愧是乡下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的话我请客  作为你搭救我的谢礼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别客气别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放学后有时间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:28.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚转校过来很闲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有过这种经历
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.93,0:10:31.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事情也算我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了表示你的歉意  放学后要请我吃牛扒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根本不是牛扒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:44.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人的话  我就请不起肉类了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:47.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是难以置信  你刚刚明明完全摆着一副吃肉的嘴脸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃肉的嘴脸是指什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃肉的嘴脸就是吃肉的嘴脸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天发现的遗体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现断定为地方电视台的女播音员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,——27岁的山野真由美小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据稻羽市警方的调查…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是昨天发生的案件吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到我们身边会发生这么可怕的案件啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人说不定就在那边徘徊着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别说了  我都起鸡皮疙瘩了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:12.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在开玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们聊点更愉快的话题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  你们知道最近街头巷尾流传的「午夜电视」吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午夜电视？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「在雨夜的午夜零点整  独自一人观看关闭着的电视」对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  据说画面中映照出的人就是你命中注定的另一半
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚好像要下雨  大家要不要一起试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.35,0:11:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真亏你每次都能因为这种哄小孩的传闻而激动半天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你  你居然说这话题是哄小孩的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:45.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为这样你才交不到男朋友哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我说的有点过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有男朋友还真是抱歉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  小西学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学姐～
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  是小花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.49,0:11:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:11:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像没什么精神啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我只是有点累而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.94,0:12:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你是转校生来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙的朋友很少的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  但是小花是个爱管闲事的好人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是觉得他烦人的话可要直说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:21.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  怎么会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学姐  这玩笑可一点也不好笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我差不多该回去工作了  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学姐  我之前跟你说的那件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊嗯  行啊  下次有空的话我会和你联系的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:41.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:43.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么什么？怎么了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  原来是这么一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:56.12,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(10,90)}山野女主播离奇死亡事件\N采访遗体的第一发现者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:56.12,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn@微软雅黑\frz-90\pos(620,195)}当地的高中生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问你第一眼看到遗体的时候有什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那  那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有在这附近发现什么可疑人物？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？我什么都…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以上是对第一发现者的采访
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受害人山野女主播
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生前与一名身为议员秘书的男性有着婚外情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此正对其交际关系进行调查…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天他也工作了一整夜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}警方正在考虑作为案件和事故的两种可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这是他的工作  所以也没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,JUNES的每一天都是顾客感谢日
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请来  看  并接触吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Everyday Younglife JUNES
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去洗个澡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.39,0:14:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会这么巧吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:05.54,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\pos(483,35)}模拟信号
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾即为汝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汝即为吾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汝是为开启门扉之人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才是怎么一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.87,eyecatch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(130,0)\pos(390,38)}{\1c000000\fs20\bord0}「勇气」\N{\r}没志气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.87,eyecatch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(130,0)\pos(300,112)}{\1c000000\fs20\bord0}「知识」\N{\r}不明事理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.87,eyecatch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(130,0)\pos(520,112)}{\1c000000\fs20\bord0}「毅力」\N{\r}窝囊废
